atter</i>&lt;std::range_format::string&gt;::</span>format<br><span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::<i>range-default-formatter</i>&lt;std::range_format::debug_string&gt;::</span>format</h2>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> FormatContext <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> format<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/* see below */</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> r, FormatContext<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> ctx <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> FormatContext<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">iterator</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/input_range\"><span class=\"kw2920\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">input_range</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> R<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, the type of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">r</span></code> is <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> R<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span></span>. Otherwise, the type is <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">R<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span></span>.\n</p><p>Let <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">s</span></code> be a <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1236\">s